<title>USA: Lukens postpones price rise until June 1.</title>
<headline>Lukens postpones price rise until June 1.</headline>
<dateline>COATESVILLE, Pa. 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lukens Inc on Thursday said it postponed a price increase on stainless steel until June 1.</p>
<p>The specialty steel manufacturer previously said the price increase would take effect on May 5.</p>
<p>Earlier the company said it would raise the price of stainless sheet, strip, continuous mill plate and plate mill products by about 5.0 percent. The price increase applies to all 200-, 300- and 400-series stainless steel grades.</p>
</text>
